  "description": "The Saxon frame features a smooth hourglass style headtube and minimal dropouts, and the unique seat tube design gives your feet more room to pinch during tabletops and tailwhips. Available in x3 colours and your choice of 20.4″ or 20.8″, the Saxon frame is perfect for the modern-day skatepark shredder.\nThe Saxon frame features a super short 12.75″ chainstay and 8″ stand over height keep it nimble, whilst the lower 11.5″ bottom bracket and 75-degree headtube keep the frame stable whilst blasting transitions.\nINCLUDES LIFETIME GUARANTEE.\n\ntechnical skatepark geometry\n\noval seat tube for extra foot clearance\n\nMid size BB and integrated head tube\n\n117mm tall headtube\n\nremovable brake mounts & cable guides and holes for rotor tabs on head tube\n\nINCLUDES LIFETIME GUARANTEE\n\nCNC machined 6mm thick and heat treated",
